Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.19,0:04:57.24,OP_JP_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur1}Lost in the noise, drowning inside
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.57,0:05:00.11,OP_JP_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur1}But I won't break, I will never lose myself
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.11,0:05:02.24,OP_JP_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur1}So rise again, I find myself
